    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Resmetirom (thyroid beta-receptor agonist) for MASH with moderate to severe (F2-F3) fibrosis reversed steatosis and MASH in 30% and improved fibrosis in 25% in a randomized trial; most common adverse effects are diarrhea and nausea."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
