      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Preliminary evidence: thiazolidinediones and vitamin E can help correct biochemical and histologic abnormalities but may not reduce fibrosis; high-dose vitamin E is contraindicated in diabetes."
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
 },
